<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss govt calls 6.5 pct 1999 bond at par.</title>
<headline>Swiss govt calls 6.5 pct 1999 bond at par.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss federal government is calling its 6.5 percent bond due July 16, 1999 and will redeem the bonds at par on July 16, 1997, the Swiss National Bank said.</p>
<p>The nominal amount of the bond, issued in 1990, was 497 million Swiss francs.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
